From f77cf2df49951dfb19d3fcbcf713cbddd6a999ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 18:01:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix toast overlapping open-sheet content (visible via AI-scan
 multi-add)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

#toast used a fixed bottom-of-screen position tuned for no-sheet-open
layouts. With a tall sheet open — most visibly the AI-scan results list,
which stays open after each tap so the user can keep adding more matched
items — that fixed position landed ON TOP of the sheet's own content
instead of below it: the "أضيفت..." confirmation rendered directly over
the "أضفه يدوياً" button underneath it, obscuring it. Not new to this
feature (any open sheet + showToast() could trigger it, e.g. deep in a
long list), but the AI flow's "stay open, keep tapping" pattern made it
the most likely place to actually see it in practice.

#overlay is only ever .show while a sheet is open, so use that sibling
relationship to move the toast to the top of the screen instead whenever
a sheet is open — clear of any sheet regardless of its content height.
The no-sheet-open case (bottom nav visible) is untouched, verified via
screenshot, and the existing undo-toast pointer-events/click-target
regression test still passes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docs/css/styles.css | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/css/styles.css b/docs/css/styles.css
index b843ece..b2bfef6 100644
--- a/docs/css/styles.css
+++ b/docs/css/styles.css
@@ -707,6 +707,16 @@ input{font-family:inherit; color:inherit;}
 #toast.show{opacity:1; transform:translate(-50%,0); pointer-events:auto;}
 #toast .tick{color:var(--success); font-size:15px; display:flex; flex:0 0 auto;}
 #toast .tick svg{width:15px; height:15px;}
+/* The toast's usual spot (164px above the bottom nav) assumes no sheet is
+   open. With a sheet open — especially a tall one like the AI-scan results
+   list, which stays open after each add so the user can keep tapping more
+   items — that fixed position lands ON TOP OF the sheet's own content
+   instead of below it (confirmed: "أضيفت..." rendered directly over the
+   "أضفه يدوياً" button underneath it). #overlay is only ever .show while a
+   sheet is open, so use it to move the toast to the top of the screen
+   instead, clear of any sheet regardless of its height. */
+#overlay.show ~ #toast{ bottom:auto; top:calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-top)); transform:translate(-50%, -20px); }
+#overlay.show ~ #toast.show{ transform:translate(-50%, 0); }
 
 .day-card{ background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border-soft); border-radius:var(--r-lg); padding:14px 16px; margin-bottom:10px; box-shadow:var(--shadow-2); }
 .day-card .dh{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:8px;}
